Write-Host "    D2:  nids_capture: added doc comment to capture_packets"
Write-Host "    D3:  minifilter_reader: added doc comments to eventTypeToString/operationToString/severityToString"
Write-Host "    D4:  windows_capture: added doc comment to capture_packets"
Write-Host "    D5:  bridge_init: added doc comment to initAll, updated g_shutdown doc (was stale ExitProcess ref)"
Write-Host "    C1:  nids_analyze: relocated misplaced SDDL comment (was after ReadFile extern)"
Write-Host "    C2:  nids_analyze: fixed misleading CTRL+C comment in bridgeStatusReporter"
Write-Host "    C3:  nids_analyze: TOP_N_RULES named constant (was magic 5)"
